    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d962">

                <pb facs="0740" n="624" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg624"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/13836.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Belt to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mexico City</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-11-19">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 19, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Obregón issued formal declaration of war against Villa tonight. Document given to
                    press tonight late. Obregón expects to leave November 21 for Salina Cruz.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">J. W. Belt</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
